Package: micsPlusTableR
Title: MICS Plus Excel Tabulation and Review Application
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: person("MICS Plus", "Tabulation Team", email = "micsplustabler@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides the MICS Plus Tabulation application for preparing,
    calculating, checking, exploring, and exporting survey tables from an
    Excel tabulation plan, survey data, and a survey-specific preparation
    script. The package is built primarily to support this browser-based
    application. Its documented R functions expose the supporting engine for
    reference, testing, and workflows run directly in R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: bslib, dplyr, flextable, haven, here, htmltools, htmlwidgets,
        janitor, jsonlite, later, officer, openxlsx2, purrr, reactable, readr, readxl,
        rlang, shiny, shinyFiles, stringr, tibble, tidyr, tidyxl,
        ggplot2, Hmisc, labelled, memisc, reshape2, RM.weights, survey, srvyr
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/micsPlusTableR/prep-packages: ggplot2, Hmisc, labelled, memisc,
        reshape2, RM.weights, survey, srvyr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: no
Config/build/clean-inst-doc: FALSE
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
